{
  "id": "456",
  "title": "Internet is Slow",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2018-01-28",
  "synopsis": "There seems to be an issue with the internet connection at the office.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/634/b5e365776f96985c50c7b2e049a1dc54c18bbf5f.mp3?1698351808",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "网速好慢\n\n小张：好慢啊！\n小何：你是说网速吗？\n小张：是啊！我刚刚想上公司主页，花了1分钟才打开。\n小何：我也是。连邮件都发不出去。\n小张：我打电话问一下技术部的人吧，让他们帮我们看看。\n小何：好的。",
    "traditional": "網速好慢\n\n小張：好慢啊！\n小何：你是說網速嗎？\n小張：是啊！我剛剛想上公司主頁，花了1分鐘才打開。\n小何：我也是。連郵件都發不出去。\n小張：我打電話問一下技術部的人吧，讓他們幫我們看看。\n小何：好的。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Internet is Slow"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小张：好慢啊！",
      "traditional": "小張：好慢啊！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng hǎo màn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: It's so slow!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小何：你是说网速吗？",
      "traditional": "小何：你是說網速嗎？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ shì shuō wǎng sù ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Are you talking about the internet connection?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小张：是啊！我刚刚想上公司主页，花了1分钟才打开。",
      "traditional": "小張：是啊！我剛剛想上公司主頁，花了1分鐘才打開。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng shì a wǒ gāng gang xiǎng shàng gōng sī zhǔ yè huā le 1 fēn zhōng cái dǎ kāi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: Yes! I wanted to open the company homepage just now. It took a whole minute to open."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小何：我也是。连邮件都发不出去。",
      "traditional": "小何：我也是。連郵件都發不出去。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé wǒ yě shì lián yóu jiàn dōu fā bù chū qù",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Same here. I can't even send an email."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "小张：我打电话问一下技术部的人吧，让他们帮我们看看。",
      "traditional": "小張：我打電話問一下技術部的人吧，讓他們幫我們看看。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo zhāng wǒ dǎ diàn huà wèn yí xià jì shù bù de rén ba ràng tā men bāng wǒ men kàn kan",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Zhang: I'll call the IT department and have them help us investigate."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小何：好的。",
      "traditional": "小何：好的。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Okay."
    }
  ],
